## 3. Design tokens

Framework-agnostic CSS variables. Every color and size in the build derives from these — no ad-hoc hex values, no arbitrary Tailwind values like `text-[#ff6600]`.

```css
:root {
  /* Surfaces — brief-specified. Avoid flat medium gray anywhere. */
  --ist-bg:            #0D0D0D;  /* page base */
  --ist-surface:       #141414;  /* cards, panels */
  --ist-surface-raised:#1A1A1A;  /* hover, modals, nav overlay */

  /* Lines */
  --ist-line:          #262626;  /* hairline dividers, card borders */
  --ist-line-strong:   #333333;  /* emphasis rules */

  /* Text — warm white, never blue-white */
  --ist-text:          #F0EDE8;  /* primary */
  --ist-text-muted:    #A8A29B;  /* secondary body, 7.7:1 */
  --ist-text-dim:      #8A857E;  /* captions, eyebrows, 5.3:1 — dimmest allowed */

  /* Accent — burnt orange / copper, restrained */
  --ist-accent:        #C45200;  /* fills, rules, large display accents */
  --ist-accent-bright: #F07422;  /* links + small text on dark, 6.7:1 */
  --ist-accent-deep:   #8F3C00;  /* pressed states, dense backgrounds */
  --ist-accent-wash:   rgba(196, 82, 0, 0.08); /* tints, hover fills */

  /* Focus */
  --ist-focus:         #F07422;

  /* Radii — near-square. Deep tech, not consumer SaaS. */
  --r-sm: 2px;
  --r-md: 4px;
  --r-lg: 6px;

  /* Motion */
  --ease-out: cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
  --dur-fast: 180ms;
  --dur-base: 320ms;
  --dur-slow: 600ms;
}
```

**Contrast rules — do not deviate:**

- `--ist-accent` (#C45200) is **4.2:1** on the black background. **It fails AA for body-size text.** Use it for fills, rules, icons, and display type ≥24px bold only.
- For links and any orange text under 24px, use `--ist-accent-bright` (#F07422) — 6.7:1. ✓
- On a solid `--ist-accent` fill, button labels must be **pure `#FFFFFF`** (4.6:1 ✓). `--ist-text` on orange is 3.9:1 and fails. Alternatively use ≥18.66px bold.
- Never place `--ist-text-dim` on anything lighter than `--ist-surface-raised`.

**Tailwind v4** — map in your CSS entry:

```css
@theme {
  --color-ist-bg: var(--ist-bg);
  --color-ist-surface: var(--ist-surface);
  --color-ist-line: var(--ist-line);
  --color-ist-text: var(--ist-text);
  --color-ist-muted: var(--ist-text-muted);
  --color-ist-dim: var(--ist-text-dim);
  --color-ist-accent: var(--ist-accent);
  --color-ist-accent-bright: var(--ist-accent-bright);
}
```

Accent usage budget: **no more than three orange elements visible in any single viewport.** If a fourth appears, demote it to `--ist-text-muted`.

