| `Card` | `--ist-surface`, 1px `--ist-line` border, `--r-md`. Hover: border → `--ist-accent` at 40%, translateY(-2px), 180ms. |
| `StepCard` | Mono key (STORE / ROUTE / ADAPT / DELIVER), icon, title, body. Used on both product pages. |
| `FeatureTile` | Icon + short title + one-line body. |
| `StackLayer` | Row with layer name, product name or `—`, status tag. Status: `CURRENT` (accent, solid rule) / `IN DEVELOPMENT` (muted, dashed rule) / `COMING SOON` (dim, dashed rule). |
| `ApplicationTile` | Photographic background, dark gradient scrim (`rgba(13,13,13,0.35)` → `0.85`), label + one line. |
| `NetworkDiagram` | SVG, hand-authored. Solid / dashed / absent links, packets in transit, stored at intermediate nodes, final state = all nodes complete. Animated on scroll into view. |
| `Nav` | Sticky, transparent over hero → `--ist-surface` with backdrop blur after 80px scroll. Mobile: full-screen overlay on `--ist-surface-raised` — **`--ist-text` on `--ist-surface-raised`, never dark text on dark gray.** |
| `Footer` | Nav columns, LinkedIn + X only, "Denver, Colorado, USA", legal. **No email.** |
| `ContactForm` | Fields below. Inline validation, visible error text, success state that replaces the form. |
| `GatedDownload` | Name + email → paper PDF. Insights page. |

Icons: single-weight line icons, 1.5px stroke, 24px grid, monochrome `--ist-text-muted`, accent on hover. Lucide or a custom set. No filled/duotone/3D icons.

