Header `[LOCKED]`:

> # Locus: Assured Distribution for the Real World
>
> Locus is IST's assured distribution engine. It ensures mission-critical information continues moving through dynamic, intermittently connected networks until delivery is complete.

**Four-step flow** — icons + mono keys:

| Key | Title | Body |
|---|---|---|
| STORE | Intelligently Store | Critical data is stored across the network — never lost, always available for forward delivery. |
| ROUTE | Find the Best Path | Locus continuously evaluates available links and routes information along the optimal available path. |
