## 10. Imagery

Prioritize **real operational photography** — satellites, ships, drones, command centers, field environments. Where product screenshots or simulation captures exist and are approved, use them. Where they don't, use high-quality photorealistic imagery of real operational environments.

The glowing-nodes-on-dark-background AI graphic is everywhere in this category and undermines differentiation. Avoid it.

Treatment: desaturate 10–20%, warm the shadows slightly toward the palette, apply a `--ist-bg` gradient scrim so text always sits at AA contrast. Consistent across every image.

All images are directional placeholders until explicitly marked approved. Reference paths under `/public/img/` and list every one you used in your build summary so they can be swapped.

