## 12. Acceptance checklist

Run this before declaring done. Report pass/fail per line — do not summarize.

**Content integrity**
- [ ] Zero fabricated metrics, statistics, testimonials, or counters anywhere
- [ ] Zero fabricated UI screenshots — all product visuals are illustrated diagrams
- [ ] Zero names, specs, or descriptions for unreleased hardware/interop/ecosystem layers
