## 13. Standing note for the agent

IST is an early-stage platform company. The site should look and feel like the company it is becoming, not just the two products shipping today.

**Signal boldly. Claim only what is true.**

If you think a section could be communicated better, say so in your summary and propose it — this is a collaboration, not a pixel-matching exercise. But never resolve ambiguity by inventing content. When the spec doesn't cover something, ask or leave a documented placeholder.
